1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,210
Two traps.

2
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:04,557
p H is not stuck between zero and fourteen.

3
00:00:04,557 --> 00:00:09,375
Two molar hydrochloric acid has p H minus zero point three.

4
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:13,828
Five molar sodium hydroxide has p H fourteen point seven.

5
00:00:13,828 --> 00:00:20,039
And the concentration must be in moles per litre, so convert any grams per litre first.

